1	line	Clay golem	Damage repaired...
1	line	Clay golem	Thank you. My body and mind are fully healed.
1	line	Clay golem	Now I must complete my task by defeating the great enemy.
1	line	Player	What enemy?
1	line	Clay golem	A great demon. It broke through from its dimension to attack the city.
1	line	Clay golem	The golem army was created to fight it. Many were destroyed, but we drove the demon back!
1	line	Clay golem	The demon is still wounded. You must open the portal so that I can strike the final blow and complete my task.
