2	line	Player	How do I open the portal?
2	line	Clay golem	The four statuettes in the temple must be turned to the correct pattern.
2	line	Clay golem	I do not know the pattern. Golems are not permitted to open the portal.
2	action	end
1	option	What makes you think you can defeat the demon?
2	line	Player	What makes you think you can defeat the demon?
2	line	Clay golem	If not I, then who else? No living being can destroy the demon. That is why the golems were created in the first place.
2	line	Clay golem	But the demon was badly wounded and elder-demons heal very slowly indeed. It was almost dead when it retreated to its own dimension.
2	line	Clay golem	Now that I am repaired, I will be able to destroy it easily!
2	action	end
1	option	I'll get right on it.
