1	option	What is this place?
2	line	Player	What is this place?
2	line	Elissa	In the Third Age, this was a great city. Look at these giant walls! They put Varrock to shame!
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	I don't know, Varrock is pretty impressive.
3	line	Player	I don't know, Varrock palace is impressive.
3	line	Elissa	Hmph. I don't think it will look this good when it's been buried in the ground for three thousand years!
3	action	end
2	option	What happened to the city?
3	line	Player	What happened to the city?
3	line	Elissa	No one knows for sure.
3	line	Elissa	But the Third Age was a time of destruction, when the gods were violently at war.
3	line	Elissa	Many great civilizations were destroyed then.
3	action	end
1	option	I found a letter in the desert with your name on.
2	line	Player	I found a letter in the desert with your name on.
2	line	Elissa	Ah, so you've found the ruins of Uzer.
2	line	Elissa	AI wrote that letter to my late husband when he was exploring there.
2	line	Elissa	that was a great city as well, but the museum could only fund one excavation and this one was closer to home.
2	line	Elissa	If you're interested in his expedition, the notes he made are in the library in the Exam Centre.
2	action	end
